      },
      "text": "12-Day Venezuela Tour with Caribbean Beach Time"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e86bb393d491a04900cacd64e39492ff280a1bd61eae59e6e0f8cc9e46e8b751",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-chat-20261110-0451-41d9d0b7bf00",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Over 12 days, you'll see very different sides of Venezuela. Visit Caracas, spend time on the white-sand beaches of the Los Roques archipelago, walk behind the curtain of water at El Sapo Falls and travel by river to Angel Falls. Then head into the Orinoco Delta to meet the Indigenous Warao people. The trip ends with time to relax on Margarita Island in the Caribbean."
    },
